解析H.264流和AAC流是一个相对复杂的过程，特别是在不使用ffmpeg库的情况下。然而，你可以选择使用其他开源库或者通过手动解析流中的NALU单元（H264）或ADTS帧（AAC）来实现。

对于H.264流，你可以使用开源库 x264（https://www.videolan.org/developers/x264.html）或OpenH264（https://github.com/cisco/openh264）。这些库提供了一系列用于解析H.264流的API。以下是使用x264库解析H.264流的简单示例：

```cpp
#include <x264.h>
#include <stdint.h>
#include <stdio.h>

void parse_h264_stream(const uint8_t *buffer, int length) {
    x264_nal_t *nal = NULL;
    int i_nal = 0;

    int result = x264_nal_decode(&nal, &i_nal, (uint8_t *)buffer, length);
    if (result < 0) {
        printf("Error decoding H.264 stream\n");
        return;
    }

    for (int i = 0; i < i_nal; i++) {
        x264_nal_t *current_nal = &nal[i];
        printf("NAL unit type: %d\n", current_nal->i_type);
    }

    x264_nal_release(nal);
}
```

对于AAC流，FAAD2（http://www.audiocoding.com/downloads.html）是一个用于解析AAC音频流的库。以下是使用FAAD库解析AAC流的简单示例：

```cpp
#include <neaacdec.h>
#include <stdint.h>
#include <stdio.h>

void parse_aac_stream(const uint8_t *buffer, int length) {
    NeAACDecHandle handle = NeAACDecOpen();

    NeAACDecConfigurationPtr conf = NeAACDecGetCurrentConfiguration(handle);
    conf->outputFormat = FAAD_FMT_16BIT; // output format, left as default
    NeAACDecSetConfiguration(handle, conf);

    long unsigned int sample_rate;
    unsigned char channels;
    int result = NeAACDecInit(handle, (uint8_t *)buffer, length, &sample_rate, &channels);
    if (result < 0) {
        printf("Error initializing AAC decoder\n");
        NeAACDecClose(handle);
        return;
    }

    NeAACDecFrameInfo frame_info;
    void *sample_buffer = NeAACDecDecode(handle, &frame_info, (uint8_t *)buffer, length);

    if (frame_info.error > 0) {
        printf("Error decoding frame: %s\n", NeAACDecGetErrorMessage(frame_info.error));
    } else {
        printf("AAC frame decoded successfully\n");
    }

    NeAACDecClose(handle);
}
```

请注意，这些示例假定你已经从输入流或文件中读取了原始的H.264或AAC数据。要手动解析这些格式，你需要了解H.264和AAC的详细规范，比如ISO/IEC 14496-10（H.264）和ISO/IEC 14496-3（AAC）。

Creating a simple Gioui golang todos app involves several steps. Gioui is a modern UI library for Golang that uses GPU-efficient rendering techniques.

1. Install the Golang and Gioui library: Make sure you have Golang installed on your system, preferably the latest version. You can get it from [here](https://golang.org/doc/install). Then, install the Gioui library using the following command:

   ```
   go get gioui.org/cmd/gio@latest
   ```

2. Create a file called `main.go` and open it in your favorite text editor for Golang. Here's a simple todo app that you can use as a starting point:

   ```go
   package main

   import (
   	"gioui.org/app"
   	"gioui.org/layout"
   	"gioui.org/unit"
   	"gioui.org/widget"
   )

   func main() {
   	go func() {
   		w := app.NewWindow(app.Title("Todos"), app.Size(unit.Dp(320), unit.Dp(480)))
   		todos := make([]string, 0)
   		newTask := &widget.Editor{}
   		list := &layout.List{}
   		for e := range w.Events() {
   			if e, ok := e.(app.UpdateEvent); ok {
   				gtx := layout.NewContext(&e.Config, e.Queue, e.Size)
   				inputField := layout.Rigid(
   					func(gtx layout.Context) layout.Dimensions {
   						newTask.Layout(gtx, &e.Config)
   						if newTask.Submit() {
   							text := newTask.Text()
   							todos = append(todos, text)
   							newTask.SetText("")
   						}
   						return layout.Dimensions{}
   					})
   				todoList := layout.Flexed(1,
   					func(gtx layout.Context) layout.Dimensions {
   						return list.Layout(gtx, len(todos), func(gtx layout.Context, index int) layout.Dimensions {
   							text := todos[index]
   							widget.Label{Align: layout.Start}.Layout(gtx, &e.Config, text)
   							return layout.Dimensions{}
   						})
   					})
   				layout.Flex{
   					Axis:    layout.Vertical,
   					Spacing: layout.SpaceEvenly,
   				}.Layout(gtx, inputField, todoList)
   				w.Update(gtx)
   			}
   		}
   	}()

   	app.Main()
   }
   ```

3. Compile and run the app using the Gioui command:

   ```
   gio run main.go
   ```

The provided example creates a simple todo app with an editor for entering new tasks and a list to display the existing tasks. Feel free to extend and modify the example to meet your specific requirements.

To learn more about the Gioui library, check out the [Gioui documentation](https://gioui.org/docs/getting-started).

下面是C#中根据字段多条件查询的代码示例：

```csharp
var settings = new ConnectionSettings(new Uri("http://localhost:9200"));
var client = new ElasticClient(settings);

var response = client.Search<MyIndex>(s => s
    .Query(q => q
        .Bool(b => b
            .Must(
                m => m.Match(t => t.Field(f => f.Field1).Query("value1")),
                m => m.Match(t => t.Field(f => f.Field2).Query("value2"))
            )
        )
    )
);

foreach(var hit in response.Hits)
{
    Console.WriteLine($"Field1: {hit.Source.Field1}, Field2: {hit.Source.Field2}");
}
```

在上面的示例中，我们使用`match`查询来匹配`Field1`和`Field2`字段的值，然后将它们组合成一个`must`条件。最后，我们通过循环遍历结果集中的每个匹配项来获取满足条件的文档的`Field1`和`Field2`的值。

